  <item>
    <title>49.夏天为什么越热越累？聊聊身体里的暑气</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a915b74a0210c197dc9ab1e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a915b74a0210c197dc9ab1e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一到夏天，你是不是也总觉得又困、又累、又烦躁？明明一直喝水，还是口干；白天离不开空调和冰饮，晚上却睡不好。</span></p><p><span>这一期，我们从中医里的“暑气”聊起：为什么暑总爱夹着湿？为什么夏天更容易耗气伤津？冰饮、空调、出汗到底怎么把握？也聊聊中暑、烦躁、乏力这些常见问题该怎么看。</span></p><p><span>夏天不是只能硬扛，顺着季节过，身体也会轻松一点。</span></p><p><strong><span>&nbsp;【主播】</span></strong></p><p><span>时一：听众嘴替，喜欢中医，乐于分享</span></p><p><span>超超：95后中医世家传承人，脆皮牛马的闺蜜中医</span></p><p><strong><span>【后期】</span></strong></p><p><span>麦麦</span></p><p><strong><span>【收听指南】</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13">00:13</a></span></strong><span> 暑气本来就是夏天的一部分</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="136">02:16</a></span></strong><span> 为什么暑气总爱带着湿气来？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a></span></strong><span> 一到夏天就没电，不一定是懒</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a></span></strong><span> 夏天的恶性循环怎么来的？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">09:27</a></span></strong><span> 莫名烦躁不一定全是情绪</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a></span></strong><span> 养身体第一件事是少一点冰</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a></span></strong><span> 中暑不是缓一缓就好</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">25:02</a></span></strong><span> 夏天真正要防的是空调</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/68538212201e911b92f41974/lky2H29736u6fzx2o8Mt9ONfsrO4.m4a" length="25967738" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:26:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiTsA1YeExDoUGoKvmkX1b1zWZTn.png"/>
