  <item>
    <title>41.湿气如渣男：允许他路过，绝不许他停留</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a056a38e1eb34a9396248ad</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a056a38e1eb34a9396248ad</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 07:11:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>中医闺蜜再次合体！ 这一期，我们把“湿气”这个老生常谈的话题聊出了新花样。</span></p><p><strong><span>为什么会得结节？</span></strong><span> 听超超从水液代谢的脉络讲到新冠后的身体变化。</span></p><p><strong><span>南方煲汤 VS 北方燥湿：</span></strong><span> 养生不能照搬，最适合你的可能就在当地的菜市场里。</span></p><p><strong><span>终极祛湿大法：</span></strong><span> 像太阳一样生活。</span></p><p><span>别再为湿气重焦虑了。与其想方设法排毒，不如先学会温养。快来听听，如何通过一杯茶、一顿姜枣水，甚至是一场阳光下的散步，找回干爽的自己。</span></p><p><strong><span>【主播】</span></strong></p><p><span>时一：听众嘴替，喜欢中医，乐于分享</span></p><p><span>超超 ：95后中医世家传承人，脆皮牛马的闺蜜中医</span></p><p><strong><span>【后期】</span></strong></p><p><span>麦麦</span></p><p><strong><span>【收听指南】</span></strong></p><h3><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a></span></strong><strong><span> - 中医里的"湿气"是什么？</span></strong></h3><h3><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="282">04:42</a></span></strong><strong><span> - 湿气的危害：从湿到痰到结</span></strong></h3><h3><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a></span></strong><strong><span> - 湿气的来源</span></strong></h3><h3><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a></span></strong><strong><span> - 祛湿的核心原则：升起身体的"太阳"</span></strong></h3><h3><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="798">13:18</a></span></strong><strong><span> - 夏季祛湿实用方法</span></strong></h3><h3><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="995">16:35</a></span></strong><strong><span> - 饮食祛湿：因地制宜</span></strong></h3><h3><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">23:25</a></span></strong><strong><span> - 祛湿王牌？红豆薏米水</span></strong></h3><h3><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1648">27:28</a></span></strong><strong><span> - 祛湿先"做减法"：去冰！</span></strong></h3><h3><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1776">29:36</a></span></strong><strong><span> - 做干爽的脆皮青年，做身体里有小太阳的人</span></strong></h3><p></p>]]></description>
